Error [E0109]: `+` can't compare or combine Int? and Int (a whole number)
  --> optional_flow_narrowing_rejects_unstable_subjects_4.jet:6:11
    |
  6 |     print(x + 1)
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: The operator has no built-in rule and no user-defined `impl Type.Trait` hook for this operand pair
 Fix: Use a supported operand pair, call a named method, or implement the operator's hook trait on your own type for this pair
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0109
